# ::tok The Tourism Bureau organized a large - scale Hong Kong inspection team of over 100 people , composed of representatives from the Hong Kong government 's tourism department , the tourism industry , and the media , to visit Macau . The two - day ( 10th and 11th ) itinerary included not only work meetings and industry discussions , but also visits to various tourist attractions , hotels , and tourism - related facilities in Macau by representatives of the Hong Kong travel agency industry and the media . This was done to introduce the latest Macau tourism products to the Hong Kong market , while also promoting cultural and tourism linkage between the two places , and jointly developing the Hong Kong - Macau " connected travel " market .
