# ::tok " Everyone would consider , ' I 've spent so much money , I need to send someone to manage it , right ? ' This is a common behavior , " however , Zheng Yonggang was different . On the day of the successful acquisition of Shanshan , Zheng Yonggang publicly announced at Shanjing Optoelectronics that Shanshan , as the major shareholder of Shanjing , decided to implement a ' one enterprise , two systems ' policy . Apart from Zheng Yonggang serving as the chairman , no one from Shanshan Enterprises would be sent to Shanjing . They would adopt an authorized management approach , and the original distribution system , corporate culture , and various management models would remain unchanged .
