# ::tok After purchasing , everything else was fine except for the software connection , which just could n't connect . My home uses a TP router , and after searching online , I found that many people have this problem . I spent over two hours adjusting various router settings , and finally managed to set it up using 360 WIFI as a medium . During this time , I called Xiaomi customer service , but they did n't have any solutions for this problem and directly told me to contact Amazon for after - sales service .
